# Line endings: this repo is LF-only. Byte-exact content must not have
# its line endings rewritten by a checkout: committed manifests record
# sha256 digests of checked-in files (fixtures/imports/*/manifest.json),
# and a Windows checkout with autocrlf=true would turn their LF into
# CRLF and break the digests on import ("export package tampered").
# `text=auto eol=lf` forces LF in the working tree on every platform.
# (Verified in a scratch repo with core.autocrlf=true: `* text=lf`
# alone still checks out CRLF, while `text=auto eol=lf` keeps LF.)
# PowerShell accepts LF (scripts/install.ps1 is LF already); there are
# no CRLF-native files (.bat/.cmd) in this repo.
* text=auto eol=lf
